            {
                "entry_id": "12ab692c-4eee-3236-95e6-29a73279ad7f",
                "word": "calorifère",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "921440cd-4b4f-46e7-8331-5ca912e0d3bd",
                        "entry_id": "12ab692c-4eee-3236-95e6-29a73279ad7f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "calorifères"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                        "entry_id": "12ab692c-4eee-3236-95e6-29a73279ad7f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ou Appareil de chauffage servant à distribuer la chaleur dans une maison, dans un édifice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8302ccfd-b243-491b-ab0f-8e6f0181d6e3",
                                "sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                                "text": "Calorifère à air froid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c619d7f-9048-4a18-993f-1203247b3a5d",
                                "sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                                "text": "Mais il y avait de la paille, et, serrés les uns contre les autres, se servant mutuellement de calorifères, les mobiles, la fatigue aidant, dormirent comme des soldats."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1051caab-3c86-46b4-8f86-f62d9ddd79ae",
                                "sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                                "text": "Le calorifère consiste en un fourneau cylindrique a en fonte ayant 3m,30 de hauteur et 0m,50 de diamètre. Les quatre pièces dont il se compose sont assemblées à emboîtement et lutées avec soin, pour empêcher le mélange des gaz de la combustion avec l’air envoyé dans les salles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be5b86dd-acac-4498-8463-46712cfb823d",
                                "sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                                "text": "Dieu me pardonne, mais je crois que son logis est encore plus humide que le mien ; la vérité, c’est qu’il faudrait installer partout des calorifères et que jamais on ne s’y résoudra, faute d’argent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d0ef43c-3798-4ad9-971c-eb75804b3f2f",
                                "sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                                "text": "La pièce où je vis à Paris n’est que fenêtres. L’hiver, malgré le calorifère j’y ai froid, parce que l’air y vient de partout et l’été l’excès de lumière m’y fait mal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0f25fc3-39bd-4562-b2c4-a03f0c6baa72",
                                "sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                                "text": "Les calorifères de Grand-Gué sont toujours allumés un peu trop tard et éteints un peu trop tôt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eca5e793-ae2b-4db3-9501-0ec01ffba0d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "12ab692c-4eee-3236-95e6-29a73279ad7f",
                        "source_sense_id": "adc4c50e-6e85-3f24-84a7-fd9e42d5faa1",
                        "target_lang_word": "heater",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heater",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08df293e-e8f9-3204-bb70-708d2eb52c68",
                                        "entry_id": "30a8b1d2-da88-3702-aefb-1633ea4bc702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device that produces and radiates heat, typically to raise the temperature of a room or building."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5462d58-f90d-4b13-b356-1523ed27985e",
                                                "sense_id": "08df293e-e8f9-3204-bb70-708d2eb52c68",
                                                "text": "Turn on the heater; I'm cold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e28b3d99-b2b3-4341-8576-10d608ad5e6d",
                                                "sense_id": "08df293e-e8f9-3204-bb70-708d2eb52c68",
                                                "text": "“First you've got to sit up and go into the tackroom, because you are soaking wet. And shivering.” […] The tackroom was cold, so Sam turned on the kerosene heater and found a wool cooler and wrapped her in it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9b02e79-aa0d-37e5-8253-2c92df4e2b63",
                                        "entry_id": "30a8b1d2-da88-3702-aefb-1633ea4bc702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who heats something, for example in metalworking."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64b4e77a-01b9-372b-bf4a-7e2e1d75a4a7",
                                        "entry_id": "30a8b1d2-da88-3702-aefb-1633ea4bc702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3fbf411-427b-46b8-870c-b318819699fc",
                                                "sense_id": "64b4e77a-01b9-372b-bf4a-7e2e1d75a4a7",
                                                "text": "The thug pumped two rounds from his heater into her."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "329eaf1a-2679-3df9-97f9-30ae4c2a68c3",
                                        "entry_id": "30a8b1d2-da88-3702-aefb-1633ea4bc702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fastball, especially one thrown at high velocity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da54b753-356f-4f2f-b519-9b845356a2b7",
                                                "sense_id": "329eaf1a-2679-3df9-97f9-30ae4c2a68c3",
                                                "text": "Jones threw a heater under his chin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9dd7bae8-b5d8-3e83-a9ba-e2e99ccf5275",
                                        "entry_id": "30a8b1d2-da88-3702-aefb-1633ea4bc702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extended winning streak."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "870c4e2f-b128-4cf2-8def-57622d57aa6a",
                                                "sense_id": "9dd7bae8-b5d8-3e83-a9ba-e2e99ccf5275",
                                                "text": "Emmy went on a heater in Las Vegas and came back six thousand dollars richer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35e7b11a-41eb-31e6-9b01-12f48aef2ec8",
                                        "entry_id": "30a8b1d2-da88-3702-aefb-1633ea4bc702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A medieval European shield having a rounded triangle shape like a clothes iron."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75a98314-aa65-415e-9fe1-f35880ed80bb",
                                                "sense_id": "35e7b11a-41eb-31e6-9b01-12f48aef2ec8",
                                                "text": "It can be assumed that as the earlier kite shield transformed into the heater shape, there must have been versions in between the two styles. Indeed, in artwork of the Medieval period, shields are rarely present after 1450 and even then are quite small. The development of flattop heaters from larger kite shields is likely the result of increased fighting on horseback and the use of improved armor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1540c029-7a97-33c7-a077-a14225154805",
                                        "entry_id": "30a8b1d2-da88-3702-aefb-1633ea4bc702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dead heat; a race in which two or more competitors reach the finish line simultaneously."
                                        ],
